  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Enough is enough.\n\nI'm absolutely sick and tired of companies forcing ads and pop-ups in my face while I'm playing a game. If you think this is acceptable, you're dead wrong. I WILL rally others to speak up against this garbage because too many companies have started prioritizing cash grabs over player experience.\n\nInterrupting gameplay with intrusive ads destroys immersion and is a blatant attempt to squeeze more money out of players. It’s disrespectful and absolutely unacceptable. If you go down this road, we’re going to have a massive problem.\n\nTo make matters worse, I have to post this under \"feature requests\" instead of you having a proper general feedback panel—which just shows how little you actually care about user input. And let me be clear: I pay for VRC+, and I still have to deal with this nonsense?\n\nHere’s my feature request: DON’T FORCE ADS ON MY SCREEN.\n\nIf you agree, give this a thumbs up and drop a comment. Speak up now before it’s too late.\n\nThanks. Have a nice day.",
